From: Matthias Liedtke <mliedtke@chromium.org>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 11:55:44 +0200
Subject: [M152] [wasm][deopt] Fix Wasm deopt data checks & prevent
 DeoptimizeIf cloning

Original change's description:
> [wasm][deopt] Fix Wasm deopt data checks & prevent DeoptimizeIf cloning
>
> - Avoid cloning merge blocks containing DeoptimizeIfOp in Turboshaft's
>   BranchEliminationReducer::ReduceGoto.
> - Check CodeGenerator::kSuccess in Pipeline::GenerateWasmCode and
>   CodeGenerator::GenerateWasmDeoptimizationData, and harden
>   WasmDeoptDataProcessor::Serialize, WasmDeoptView::GetDeoptEntry, and
>   Deoptimizer::DoComputeWasmLiftoffFrame with release CHECKs.
>
> Fixed: 565328105
> Change-Id: I49f5eb34609fc23bf47a79ec6e7a831f544ea8aa
> Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/v8/v8/+/8460985
> Commit-Queue: Matthias Liedtke <mliedtke@chromium.org>
> Reviewed-by: Jakob Kummerow <jkummerow@chromium.org>
> Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#110094}

